{"name": "XBMC Backup Validation File", "xbmc_version": "20.5 Debian package version: 2:20.5+dfsg-1ubuntu1", "type": 0, "system_settings": [{"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Enregistre automatiquement la partie du jeu, si pris en charge. Permet de reprendre la partie au moment o\u00f9 elle a \u00e9t\u00e9 arr\u00eat\u00e9e.", "id": "gamesgeneral.enableautosave", "label": "Activer l'enregistrement automatique (si pris en charge)", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet de revoir en temps r\u00e9el la partie pendant le jeu. Appuyer sur la touche correspondante ou revenir manuellement en arri\u00e8re en utilisant la barre de positionnement.", "id": "gamesgeneral.enablerewind", "label": "Activer le rembobinage (si pris en charge)", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "formatlabel": "{0:d} s", "popup": true, "type": "slider"}, "default": 60, "enabled": true, "help": "Temps maximal possible pour revoir le jeu. Un historique de partie de jeu important peut utiliser beaucoup de m\u00e9moire vive.", "id": "gamesgeneral.rewindtime", "label": "Dur\u00e9e maximale des parties \u00e0 revoir", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 600, "minimum": 10, "parent": "", "step": 10, "type": "integer", "value": 60}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Nom d'utilisateur du compte RetroAchievements", "id": "gamesachievements.username", "label": "Nom d'utilisateur", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": true, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Mot de passe du compte RetroAchievements", "id": "gamesachievements.password", "label": "Mot de passe", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Changez ce param\u00e8tre pour vous connecter ou d\u00e9connecter \u00e0 RetroAchievements.", "id": "gamesachievements.loggedin", "label": "Connect\u00e9", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"addontype": "xbmc.gui.skin", "allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "addon", "type": "button"}, "default": "skin.estuary", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection de l'habillage de l'interface utilisateur. Cela d\u00e9finira l'aspect et le comportement de l'application.", "id": "lookandfeel.skin", "label": "Habillage", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": "skin.aeon.nox.silvo"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "\u00c0 s\u00e9lectionner pour changer les param\u00e8tres sp\u00e9cifiques de l'habillage. Les options de configuration disponibles d\u00e9pendent des fonctionnalit\u00e9s fournies par l'habillage.", "id": "lookandfeel.skinsettings", "label": "Configurer l'habillage\u2026", "level": "basic", "parent": "lookandfeel.skin", "type": "action"}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": "SKINDEFAULT", "enabled": true, "help": "Change le th\u00e8me associ\u00e9 \u00e0 l'habillage s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9.", "id": "lookandfeel.skintheme", "label": "Th\u00e8me", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini par l'habillage", "value": "SKINDEFAULT"}], "parent": "lookandfeel.skin", "type": "string", "value": "SKINDEFAULT"}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": "SKINDEFAULT", "enabled": true, "help": "Change les couleurs de l'habillage s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9.", "id": "lookandfeel.skincolors", "label": "Couleurs", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini par l'habillage", "value": "SKINDEFAULT"}], "parent": "lookandfeel.skin", "type": "string", "value": "SKINDEFAULT"}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": "Default", "enabled": true, "help": "Choix des polices affich\u00e9es par l'interface utilisateur. Les ensembles de polices sont configur\u00e9s par l'habillage.", "id": "lookandfeel.font", "label": "Polices", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini par l'habillage", "value": "Default"}, {"label": "Arial", "value": "Arial"}, {"label": "NoTo", "value": "NoTo"}, {"label": "Raleway", "value": "Raleway"}, {"label": "Ubuntu condensed", "value": "Ubuntu Condensed"}, {"label": "Fira sans", "value": "Fira Sans"}, {"label": "Caviar dreams", "value": "Caviar Dreams"}, {"label": "Lecture standard", "value": "Play Regular"}], "parent": "lookandfeel.skin", "type": "string", "value": "Default"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} %", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet de redimensionner la vue de l'interface utilisateur.", "id": "lookandfeel.skinzoom", "label": "Zoom", "level": "standard", "maximum": 30, "minimum": -30, "parent": "lookandfeel.skin", "step": 2, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{}", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 5, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit la force de l'effet 3D st\u00e9r\u00e9oscopique qui est obtenue par le contr\u00f4le de profondeur de perception dans l'interface graphique. Plus la valeur sera \u00e9lev\u00e9e, plus le nombre d'\u00e9l\u00e9ments qui vont \u00ab ressortir \u00bb de l'\u00e9cran le sera aussi. [Z\u00e9ro] D\u00e9sactive l'effet 3D st\u00e9r\u00e9oscopique.[CR]Pour une bonne sensation visuelle, la valeur devrait \u00eatre plus \u00e9lev\u00e9e pour les petits \u00e9crans et plus faible pour les grandes diagonales. NB : sans effet dans certains habillages.", "id": "lookandfeel.stereostrength", "label": "Force de l'effet 3D st\u00e9r\u00e9oscopique", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 10, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 5}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Active ou non la barre d\u00e9filante des flux RSS.", "id": "lookandfeel.enablerssfeeds", "label": "Afficher les flux RSS", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": false, "help": "\u00c9dite les flux RSS.", "id": "lookandfeel.rssedit", "label": "\u00c9diter", "level": "standard", "parent": "lookandfeel.enablerssfeeds", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"addontype": "kodi.resource.language", "allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "addon", "type": "button"}, "default": "resource.language.en_gb", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection de la langue de l'interface utilisateur.", "id": "locale.language", "label": "Langue", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": "resource.language.fr_fr"}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": "DEFAULT", "enabled": true, "help": "Permet de choisir quel jeu de caract\u00e8res utiliser pour afficher le texte de l'interface utilisateur. Ce jeu est ind\u00e9pendant de celui utilis\u00e9 pour les sous-titres (qui est situ\u00e9 \u00e0 Lecteur > Langue).", "id": "locale.charset", "label": "Jeu de caract\u00e8res", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini", "value": "DEFAULT"}, {"label": "Arabic (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-6"}, {"label": "Arabic (Windows)", "value": "CP1256"}, {"label": "Baltic (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-4"}, {"label": "Baltic (Windows)", "value": "CP1257"}, {"label": "Central Europe (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-2"}, {"label": "Central Europe (Windows)", "value": "CP1250"}, {"label": "Chinese Simplified (GBK)", "value": "GBK"}, {"label": "Chinese Traditional (Big5)", "value": "BIG5"}, {"label": "Cyrillic (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-5"}, {"label": "Cyrillic (Windows)", "value": "CP1251"}, {"label": "Greek (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-7"}, {"label": "Greek (Windows)", "value": "CP1253"}, {"label": "Hebrew (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-8"}, {"label": "Hebrew (Windows)", "value": "CP1255"}, {"label": "Hong Kong (Big5-HKSCS)", "value": "BIG5-HKSCS"}, {"label": "Japanese (Shift-JIS)", "value": "SHIFT_JIS"}, {"label": "Korean", "value": "CP949"}, {"label": "South Europe (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-3"}, {"label": "Thai (Windows)", "value": "CP874"}, {"label": "Turkish (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-9"}, {"label": "Turkish (Windows)", "value": "CP1254"}, {"label": "Vietnamese (Windows)", "value": "CP1258"}, {"label": "Western Europe (ISO)", "value": "ISO-8859-1"}, {"label": "Western Europe (Windows)", "value": "CP1252"}], "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": "DEFAULT"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": ["English QWERTY"], "definition": {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": "English QWERTY", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection de la disposition du clavier.", "id": "locale.keyboardlayouts.definition", "label": "Dispositions du clavier virtuel", "level": "basic", "opti