 "minimumItems": 1, "parent": "", "type": "list", "value": ["English"]}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit l'emplacement des sous-titres t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9s. Au m\u00eame endroit que la vid\u00e9o ou dans un dossier personnalis\u00e9.", "id": "subtitles.storagemode", "label": "Emplacement de stockage des sous-titres", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "\u00c0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la vid\u00e9o", "value": 0}, {"label": "Emplacement personnalis\u00e9", "value": 1}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "path", "heading": "Rechercher un dossier", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit un dossier personnel pour les sous-titres. Cela peut \u00eatre un partage r\u00e9seau.", "id": "subtitles.custompath", "label": "Dossier personnalis\u00e9 des sous-titres", "level": "advanced", "parent": "subtitles.storagemode", "sources": ["videos"], "type": "path", "value": "", "writable": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Met en pause la vid\u00e9o durant la recherche de sous-titres et reprend une fois les sous-titres disponibles.", "id": "subtitles.pauseonsearch", "label": "Mettre en pause pendant la recherche de sous-titres", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "T\u00e9l\u00e9charge automatiquement le premier fichier de sous-titres du r\u00e9sultat de recherche", "id": "subtitles.downloadfirst", "label": "T\u00e9l\u00e9charger automatiquement le premier fichier de sous-titres", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"addontype": "xbmc.subtitle.module", "allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "addon", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection du service pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini pour rechercher les sous-titres des s\u00e9ries TV.", "id": "subtitles.tv", "label": "Service pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini pour les s\u00e9ries TV", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": ""}, {"addontype": "xbmc.subtitle.module", "allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "addon", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection du service pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini pour rechercher les sous-titres des films.", "id": "subtitles.movie", "label": "Service pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini pour les films", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": ""}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Afficher et g\u00e9rer les extensions client PVR disponibles.", "id": "pvrmanager.addons", "label": "Extensions client PVR", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Cette option donnera acc\u00e8s \u00e0 tous les param\u00e8tres sp\u00e9cifiques de l'enregistreur vid\u00e9o, si compatible avec l'extension enregistreur vid\u00e9o et le syst\u00e8me.", "id": "pvrclient.menuhook", "label": "Param\u00e8tres sp\u00e9cifiques au client", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Supprimer les donn\u00e9es de l'enregistreur vid\u00e9o (PVR) tels que les cha\u00eenes, groupes, rappels et guides des bases de donn\u00e9es PVR. Attention toutes les donn\u00e9es ne pourront pas \u00eatre restaur\u00e9es depuis le backend suite \u00e0 cette op\u00e9ration.", "id": "pvrmanager.resetdb", "label": "Effacer les donn\u00e9es", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Importe les groupes de cha\u00eenes depuis le serveur de l'enregistreur vid\u00e9o (si g\u00e9r\u00e9). Les groupes cr\u00e9\u00e9s par les utilisateurs seront supprim\u00e9s s'ils ne sont pas trouv\u00e9s sur le serveur.", "id": "pvrmanager.syncchannelgroups", "label": "Synchroniser les groupes de cha\u00eenes avec le(s) serveur(s)", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Trie les cha\u00eenes par num\u00e9ro de cha\u00eene du serveur mais utilise une num\u00e9rotation locale pour les cha\u00eenes.", "id": "pvrmanager.backendchannelorder", "label": "Utiliser l'ordre des cha\u00eenes du/des serveur(s)", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Ouvre le gestionnaire de cha\u00eenes qui permet de modifier l'ordre des cha\u00eenes, leurs noms, logos, etc.", "id": "pvrmanager.channelmanager", "label": "Gestionnaire de cha\u00eenes", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Ouvre le gestionnaire de groupes qui permet la modification des groupes et de leurs cha\u00eenes respectives", "id": "pvrmanager.groupmanager", "label": "Gestionnaire de groupes", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Demande au serveur de lancer la recherche des cha\u00eenes (si g\u00e9r\u00e9).", "id": "pvrmanager.channelscan", "label": "Rechercher des cha\u00eenes", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "path", "heading": "Rechercher un dossier", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Dossier o\u00f9 se trouvent les ic\u00f4nes des cha\u00eenes.", "id": "pvrmenu.iconpath", "label": "Dossier contenant les ic\u00f4nes de cha\u00eenes", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "sources": [], "type": "path", "value": "", "writable": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": false, "help": "Recherche les ic\u00f4nes manquantes des cha\u00eenes.", "id": "pvrmenu.searchicons", "label": "Rechercher des ic\u00f4nes manquantes", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} jours", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "Nombre de jours pass\u00e9s \u00e0 montrer dans le guide et \u00e0 importer depuis les serveurs.", "id": "epg.pastdaystodisplay", "label": "Jours pass\u00e9s \u00e0 afficher", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 31, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} jours", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 3, "enabled": true, "help": "Nombre de prochains jours \u00e0 montrer dans le guide et \u00e0 importer depuis les serveurs.", "id": "epg.futuredaystodisplay", "label": "Prochains jours \u00e0 afficher", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 31, "minimum": 1, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 3}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 2, "enabled": true, "help": "Quand un \u00e9l\u00e9ment est s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 dans le guide : [Afficher le menu contextuel] Montrera le menu contextuel \u00e0 partir duquel d'autres actions pourront \u00eatre choisies ; [Changer de cha\u00eene] Basculera imm\u00e9diatement vers cette cha\u00eene ; [Afficher des infos] Montrera des informations d\u00e9taill\u00e9es avec l'intrigue et d'autres options ; [Enregistrement] Cr\u00e9era une programmation pour l'\u00e9l\u00e9ment s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9. [\u00ab S\u00e9lection intelligente \u00bb] L'action est choisie dynamiquement, selon que l'\u00e9v\u00e8nement se situe dans le pass\u00e9, le pr\u00e9sent ou le futur.", "id": "epg.selectaction", "label": "Action de s\u00e9lection pr\u00e9d\u00e9finie", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Afficher le menu contextuel", "value": 0}, {"label": "Changer de cha\u00eene", "value": 1}, {"label": "Afficher les informations", "value": 2}, {"label": "Enregistrer", "value": 3}, {"label": "\u00ab S\u00e9lection intelligente \u00bb", "value": 5}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 2}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "N'affiche pas les mentions \u00ab Pas d'infos disponibles \u00bb s'il n'existe pas de donn\u00e9es de guide TV disponibles pour une cha\u00eene.", "id": "epg.hidenoinfoavailable", "label": "Masquer les mentions \u00ab Pas d'infos disponibles \u00bb", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} min", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 120, "enabled": true, "help": "Intervalle entre les importations des donn\u00e9es du guide.", "id": "epg.epgupdate", "label": "Intervalle de mise \u00e0 jour", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 2880, "minimum": 15, "parent": "", "step": 15, "type": "integer", "value": 120}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "N'importe pas les donn\u00e9es du guide lors de l'affichage d'une cha\u00eene TV afin de minimiser la charge du processeur.", "id": "epg.preventupdateswhileplayingtv", "label": "Emp\u00eacher les mises \u00e0 jour durant la lecture", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Supprime les donn\u00e9es en cache du guide et les r\u00e9importe depuis le serveur.", "id": "epg.resetepg", "label": "Effacer les donn\u00e9es", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 3, "enabled": true, "help": "Bascule en affichage plein \u00e9cran au d\u00e9marrage de la lecture des cha\u00eenes.", "id": "pvrplayback.switchtofullscreenchanneltypes", "label": "Basculer en plein \u00e9cran", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Jamais", "value": 0}, {"label": "Cha\u00eenes TV", "value": 1}, {"label": "Cha\u00eenes radio", "value": 2}, {"label": "Cha\u00eenes TV et radio", "value": 3}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 3}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Pr\u00e9s\u00e9lectionne la cha\u00eene en cours dans les fen\u00eatres et dialogues contenant des listes de cha\u00eenes. Si activ\u00e9 et qu'il existe une cha\u00eene en cours, cette derni\u00e8re sera s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e lors de leur ouverture. Si d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9, c'est la cha\u00eene pr\u00e9c\u00e9demment s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e qui le sera. ", "id": "pvrmanager.preselectplayingchannel", "label": "Pr\u00e9s\u00e9lectionner la cha\u00eene en cours de lecture dans les listes", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} s", "minimumlabel": "Non", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 5, "enabled": true, "help": "Affiche les informations du programme lors du changement de cha\u00eenes, l'\u00e9mission en cours par exemple.", "id": "pvrmenu.displaychannelinfo", "label": "Afficher les infos de cha\u00eene lors du changement de cha\u00eenes", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 15, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 5}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Ferme les incrustations \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran (OSD) apr\u00e8s un changement de cha\u00eene.", "id": "pvrmenu.closechannelosdonswitch", "label": "Fermer l'incrustation \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran apr\u00e8s un changement de cha\u00eene", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "En passant d'une cha\u00eene \u00e0 une autre avec les boutons +/-, les changements de cha\u00eene devront \u00eatre confirm\u00e9s en appuyant sur le bouton OK.", "id": "pvrplayback.confirmchannelswitch", "label": "Confirmer les changements de cha\u00eene en appuyant sur OK", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} ms", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Quand la touche de changement de cha\u00eene \u00ab + \u00bb ou \u00ab - \u00bb est utilis\u00e9e, le passage effectif \u00e0 la nouvelle cha\u00eene est retard\u00e9, permettant \u00e0 l'utilisateur d'atteindre une cha\u00eene num\u00e9rot\u00e9e sans attendre le changement de chaque cha\u00eene.", "id": "pvrplayback.channelentrytimeout", "label": "D\u00e9lai de changement de cha\u00eene", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 10000, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 250, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} s", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Si la valeur est sup\u00e9rieure \u00e0 0, la derni\u00e8re date o\u00f9 la cha\u00eene a \u00e9t\u00e9 vue sera conserv\u00e9e pendant la valeur d\u00e9finie apr\u00e8s le d\u00e9but d'affichage. Sinon la derni\u00e8re date o\u00f9 la cha\u00eene a \u00e9t\u00e9 vue sera stock\u00e9e d\u00e8s son affichage.", "id": "pvrplayback.delaymarklastwatched", "label": "D\u00e9lai date derni\u00e8re vue", "level": "expert", "maximum": 600, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 30, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Affiche la qualit\u00e9 du signal dans la fen\u00eatre des informations des codecs (si pris en charge par l'extension et le serveur).", "id": "pvrplayback.signalquality", "label": "Afficher la qualit\u00e9 du signal", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Si activ\u00e9e, cette fr\u00e9quence de trames sera utilis\u00e9e pour les diffusions dont il n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 possible d'identifier le nombre d'images par seconde.", "id": "pvrplayback.fps", "label": "Fr\u00e9quence de trames de secours", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "Non", "value": 0}, {"label": "50 Hz", "value": 1}, {"label": "59,94 Hz", "value": 2}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Permettre l'utilisation des donn\u00e9es RDS si elles sont disponibles", "id": "pvrplayback.enableradiords", "label": "Activer le RDS pour les cha\u00eenes radio", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "RDS diffuse des informations de trafic sous forme de messages de conseil", "id": "pvrplayback.trafficadvisory", "label": "Message de conseil de trafic", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d}.0 dB", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 10, "enabled": false, "help": "Si un message de conseil de trafic est diffus\u00e9 par RDS, le volume sonore est augment\u00e9", "id": "pvrplayback.trafficadvisoryvolume", "label": "Augmenter le volume lors d'un message de conseil de trafic", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 20, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 10}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Action \u00e0 ex\u00e9cuter en appuyant sur le bouton d'enregistrement :[CR][Enregistrer le programme actuel] Enregistre le programme en cours \u00e0 partir de \u00ab maintenant \u00bb jusqu'\u00e0 sa fin. S'il n'y a pas de donn\u00e9es disponibles dans le guide des programmes TV, une dur\u00e9e fixe sera planifi\u00e9e \u00e0 partir de \u00ab maintenant \u00bb jusqu'\u00e0 la valeur de \u00ab Dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement imm\u00e9diat \u00bb.[CR][Enregistrer pendant une p\u00e9riode de temps fixe] Utilise une valeur de temps fixe depuis \u00ab maintenant \u00bb jusqu'\u00e0 la valeur de \u00ab Dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement imm\u00e9diat \u00bb.[CR][Demander que faire] Ouvre une bo\u00eete de dialogue pour choisir parmi \u00ab Enregistrer le programme actuel \u00bb, \u00ab Enregistrer le programme suivant \u00bb et quelques dur\u00e9es d'enregistrement pr\u00e9\u00e9tablies.", "id": "pvrrecord.instantrecordaction", "label": "Enregistrement imm\u00e9diat", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Enregistrer le programme actuel (si donn\u00e9es du guide disponibles)", "value": 0}, {"label": "Enregistrer pendant une p\u00e9riode de temps fixe (dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement imm\u00e9diat)", "value": 1}, {"label": "Demander que faire", "value": 2}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} min", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 120, "enabled": true, "help": "Dur\u00e9e de l'enregistrement imm\u00e9diat quand le bouton d'enregistrement est press\u00e9. Cette valeur sera prise en compte si l'action \u00ab Enregistrement imm\u00e9diat \u00bb est d\u00e9finie \u00e0 [Enregistrer pendant une p\u00e9riode de temps fixe]", "id": "pvrrecord.instantrecordtime", "label": "Dur\u00e9e d'enregistrement imm\u00e9diat", "level": "standard", "maximum": 720, "minimum": 1, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 120}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Temps d'enregistrement suppl\u00e9mentaire avant l'heure de d\u00e9but planifi\u00e9e pour tol\u00e9rer des changements mineurs de diffusion. Toutes les extensions et tous les serveurs ne sont pas reconnus.", "id": "pvrrecord.marginstart", "label": "Ajustement du temps de d\u00e9but pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "0 min", "value": 0}, {"label": "1 min", "value": 1}, {"label": "3 min", "value": 3}, {"label": "5 min", "value": 5}, {"label": "10 min", "value": 10}, {"label": "15 min", "value": 15}, {"label": "20 min", "value": 20}, {"label": "30 min", "value": 30}, {"label": "60 min", "value": 60}, {"label": "90 min", "value": 90}, {"label": "120 min", "value": 120}, {"label": "180 min", "value": 180}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Temps d'enregistrement suppl\u00e9mentaire apr\u00e8s l'heure de fin planifi\u00e9e pour tol\u00e9rer des changements mineurs de diffusion. Toutes les extensions et tous les serveurs ne sont pas reconnus.", "id": "pvrrecord.marginend", "label": "Ajustement du temps de fin pr\u00e9d\u00e9fini", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "0 min", "value": 0}, {"label": "1 min", "value": 1}, {"label": "3 min", "value": 3}, {"label": "5 min", "value": 5}, {"label": "10 min", "value": 10}, {"label": "15 min", "value": 15}, {"label": "20 min", "value": 20}, {"label": "30 min", "value": 30}, {"label": "60 min", "value": 60}, {"label": "90 min", "value": 90}, {"label": "120 min", "value": 120}, {"label": "180 min", "value": 180}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Affiche une notification quand une programmation est ajout\u00e9e, termin\u00e9e ou retir\u00e9e par le serveur.", "id": "pvrrecord.timernotifications", "label": "Afficher une notification lors de mises \u00e0 jour de programmation", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} s", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 10, "enabled": true, "help": "Ceci permet de choisir une dur\u00e9e en secondes apr\u00e8s laquelle les fen\u00eatres de rappel de l'enregistreur (PVR) seront automatiquement ferm\u00e9es.", "id": "pvrreminders.autoclosedelay", "label": "Fermer auto. la fen\u00eatre de rappel apr\u00e8s", "level": "standard", "maximum": 60, "minimum": 1, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 10}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Si activ\u00e9, un enregistrement du programme sera pr\u00e9vu \u00e0 la fermeture automatique de la fen\u00eatre de rappel, si pris en charge par l'extension enregistreur vid\u00e9o (PVR) et le serveur.", "id": "pvrreminders.autorecord", "label": "Pr\u00e9voir l'enregistrement \u00e0 la fermeture auto. de la fen\u00eatre de rappel", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Si activ\u00e9e, s\u00e9lectionne la cha\u00eene du programme pr\u00e9vu \u00e0 la fermeture automatique de la fen\u00eatre de rappel.", "id": "pvrreminders.autoswitch", "label": "Afficher la cha\u00eene \u00e0 la fermeture auto. de la fen\u00eatre de rappel", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Ex\u00e9cute la commande de r\u00e9veil ci-dessous en quittant cette application ou en mettant en veille. L'horodatage du prochain enregistrement planifi\u00e9 est pass\u00e9 comme param\u00e8tre.", "id": "pvrpowermanagement.enabled", "label": "Activ\u00e9", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} min", "minimumlabel": "Non", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 15, "enabled": false, "help": "La commande ne sera pas ex\u00e9cut\u00e9e quand un enregistrement va d\u00e9marrer durant cette temporisation.", "id": "pvrpowermanagement.backendidletime", "label": "D\u00e9lai attente du serveur", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 360, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 5, "type": "integer", "value": 15}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": false, "help": "La commande \u00e0 ex\u00e9cuter (cmd [horodatage]).", "id": "pvrpowermanagement.setwakeupcmd", "label": "Commande de r\u00e9veil", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} min", "minimumlabel": "Non", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 15, "enabled": false, "help": "Temps \u00e0 soustraire de l'heure de d\u00e9marrage du prochain enregistrement planifi\u00e9.", "id": "pvrpowermanagement.prewakeup", "label": "R\u00e9veiller avant enregistrement", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 60, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 15}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Ex\u00e9cute la commande de r\u00e9veil tous les jours \u00e0 une heure donn\u00e9e.", "id": "pvrpowermanagement.dailywakeup", "label": "R\u00e9veil quotidien", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "00:00:00", "enabled": false, "help": "Quand ex\u00e9cuter la commande de r\u00e9veil journali\u00e8re.", "id": "pvrpowermanagement.dailywakeuptime", "label": "Heure de r\u00e9veil quotidien (HH:MM:SS)", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": "00:00:00"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Demande un code PIN pour acc\u00e9der aux cha\u00eenes parentales verrouill\u00e9es. Les cha\u00eenes peuvent \u00eatre marqu\u00e9es comme verrouill\u00e9es dans l'\u00e9diteur de cha\u00eenes de l'onglet g\u00e9n\u00e9ral. Les cha\u00eenes sous verrouillage parental ne peuvent \u00eatre ni regard\u00e9es, ni enregistr\u00e9es sans saisir un code PIN, et les informations du guide sont cach\u00e9es pour ces cha\u00eenes.", "id": "pvrparental.enabled", "label": "Activer", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "hidden": true, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": true}, "default": "", "enabled": false, "help": "Saisie d'un nouveau code PIN pour d\u00e9bloquer les chaines verrouill\u00e9es par contr\u00f4le parental.", "id": "pvrparental.pin", "label": "Modifier le code PIN", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} s", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 300, "enabled": false, "help": "Demande \u00e0 nouveau le code PIN pour acc\u00e9der \u00e0 une cha\u00eene verrouill\u00e9e par contr\u00f4le parental, alors que le code n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 demand\u00e9 pendant cette dur\u00e9e.", "id": "pvrparental.duration", "label": "Dur\u00e9e de d\u00e9verrouillage", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 1200, "minimum": 5, "parent": "", "step": 5, "type": "integer", "value": 300}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "Kodi", "enabled": true, "help": "Le nom de ce dispositif \u00e0 afficher lors de l'utilisation de divers services r\u00e9seau.", "id": "services.devicename", "label": "Nom du dispositif", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": "Kodi"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Autorise les applications sur le r\u00e9seau \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir les services actifs via Zeroconf.", "id": "services.zeroconf", "label": "Annoncer les services aux autres syst\u00e8mes", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet aux utilisateurs distants de contr\u00f4ler cette application par son serveur Web. Ne jamais exposer le port du serveur Web \u00e0 Internet.", "id": "services.webserver", "label": "Autoriser le contr\u00f4le \u00e0 distance via HTTP", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": true, "format": "integer", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": 8080, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit le port du serveur Web.", "id": "services.webserverport", "label": "Port", "level": "standard", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1, "parent": "services.webserver", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 8080}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9termine si les requ\u00eates au serveur Web requi\u00e8rent un nom d'utilisateur et un mot de passe (qui doivent \u00eatre d\u00e9finis si cette option est activ\u00e9e). Il est recommand\u00e9 de toujours la laisser activ\u00e9e.", "id": "services.webserverauthentication", "label": "N\u00e9cessite une authentification", "level": "standard", "parent": "services.webserver", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "kodi", "enabled": true, "help": "Permet de d\u00e9finir le nom d'utilisateur du serveur Web. Il doit \u00eatre d\u00e9fini quand l'authentification est activ\u00e9e.", "id": "services.webserverusername", "label": "Nom d'utilisateur", "level": "standard", "parent": "services.webserver", "type": "string", "value": "kodi"}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": true, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit le mot de passe du serveur Web. Il doit \u00eatre d\u00e9fini quand l'authentification est activ\u00e9e.", "id": "services.webserverpassword", "label": "Mot de passe", "level": "standard", "parent": "services.webserver", "type": "string", "value": "petit ponney"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Active le chiffrement SSL sur le serveur Web. Le certificat special://userdata/server.pem et la cl\u00e9 special://userdata/server.key doivent \u00eatre cr\u00e9\u00e9s manuellement", "id": "services.webserverssl", "label": "Activer SSL", "level": "standard", "parent": "services.webserver", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"addontype": "xbmc.webinterface", "allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "addon", "type": "button"}, "default": "webinterface.default", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lectionne l'une des interfaces Web install\u00e9es via le gestionnaire d'extensions.", "id": "services.webskin", "label": "Interface Web", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": "webinterface.tex"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet \u00e0 des programmes sur cet appareil de contr\u00f4ler cette application sans authentification via le protocole JSON-RPC sur WebSocket, JSON-RPC sur TCP ou EventServer.", "id": "services.esenabled", "label": "Autoriser le contr\u00f4le \u00e0 distance par des programmes sur ce syst\u00e8me", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet \u00e0 des programmes sur le r\u00e9seau de contr\u00f4ler cette application sans authentification via le protocole JSON-RPC sur WebSocket, JSON-RPC sur TCP ou EventServer. Quiconque ayant acc\u00e8s au r\u00e9seau aura un contr\u00f4le total de cette application et, par cons\u00e9quent, de cet appareil. Ne jamais exposer ces interfaces \u00e0 Internet.", "id": "services.esallinterfaces", "label": "Autoriser le contr\u00f4le \u00e0 distance par des programmes sur d'autres syst\u00e8mes", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Active la prise en charge UPnP. Ceci permet de diffuser les m\u00e9dias depuis les m\u00e9diath\u00e8ques vers un client UPnP, et de d\u00e9tecter les serveurs UPnP distants.", "id": "services.upnp", "label": "Activer la prise en charge UPnP", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Active le serveur UPnP. Ceci permet de diffuser le contenu d'une m\u00e9diath\u00e8que vers un client UPnP.", "id": "services.upnpserver", "label": "Partager les m\u00e9diath\u00e8ques", "level": "basic", "parent": "services.upnp", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": false, "help": "Notifie les clients UPnP lorsqu'une mise \u00e0 jour manuelle ou automatique de la m\u00e9diath\u00e8que a lieu.", "id": "services.upnpannounce", "label": "Annoncer les mises \u00e0 jour de la m\u00e9diath\u00e8que", "level": "advanced", "parent": "services.upnpserver", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Recherche de sous-titres externes pour les vid\u00e9os fournies par le serveur UPnP. Cela peut entrainer une charge \u00e9lev\u00e9e du processeur, du r\u00e9seau et du syst\u00e8me de fichiers.", "id": "services.upnplookforexternalsubtitles", "label": "Rechercher des sous-titres externes", "level": "advanced", "parent": "services.upnpserver", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Active le point de contr\u00f4le UPnP. Cela permet la diffusion de m\u00e9dias vers tout client UPnP et le contr\u00f4le de sa lecture.", "id": "services.upnpcontroller", "label": "Chercher des lecteurs UPnP distants", "level": "advanced", "parent": "services.upnpserver", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Active le client UPnP. Cela permet de contr\u00f4ler la diffusion de m\u00e9dias \u00e0 partir de n'importe quel serveur UPnP avec un point de contr\u00f4le, et de contr\u00f4ler la lecture \u00e0 partir de ce serveur.", "id": "services.upnprenderer", "label": "Autoriser le contr\u00f4le \u00e0 distance via l'UPnP", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Si activ\u00e9, le contenu d'autres dispositifs ou applications AirPlay peut \u00eatre re\u00e7u.", "id": "services.airplay", "label": "Activer la gestion d'AirPlay", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": false, "help": "Autorise le contr\u00f4le du volume par les clients AirPlay.", "id": "services.airplayvolumecontrol", "label": "Autoriser le contr\u00f4le du volume", "level": "advanced", "parent": "services.airplay", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Active la gestion de la r\u00e9ception de \u00ab Vid\u00e9os \u00bb et \u00ab Images \u00bb via AirPlay. \u00c0 d\u00e9sactiver avec les clients utilisant iOS 9 ou sup\u00e9rieur pour restaurer la diffusion de musique via AirPlay. Les \u00ab Vid\u00e9os \u00bb et \u00ab Images \u00bb sont seulement g\u00e9r\u00e9es pour les clients iOS 8 ou inf\u00e9rieur.", "id": "services.airplayvideosupport", "label": "Activer la gestion \u00ab Vid\u00e9os \u00bb et \u00ab Images \u00bb d'AirPlay", "level": "expert", "parent": "services.airplay", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Active la protection d'AirPlay par un mot de passe.", "id": "services.useairplaypassword", "label": "Utiliser une authentification par mot de passe", "level": "standard", "parent": "services.airplayvideosupport", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": true, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": false, "help": "D\u00e9finit le mot de passe AirPlay.", "id": "services.airplaypassword", "label": "Mot de passe", "level": "standard", "parent": "services.useairplaypassword", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "WORKGROUP", "enabled": true, "help": "Si un serveur WINS est pr\u00e9sent sur le r\u00e9seau, saisir son nom de groupe de travail ici. Sinon, laisser vide.", "id": "smb.workgroup", "label": "Groupe de travail", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": "WORKGROUP"}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "ip", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "0.0.0.0", "enabled": true, "help": "Si un serveur WINS est pr\u00e9sent sur le r\u00e9seau, saisir son adresse IP ici. Sinon, laisser vide.", "id": "smb.winsserver", "label": "Serveur WINS", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": "0.0.0.0"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit la version minimale du protocole SMB pour n\u00e9gocier les connexions. Forcer SMBv2 pourrait \u00eatre requis pour emp\u00eacher l'utilisation de SMBv1 sur certains syst\u00e8mes d'exploitation.", "id": "smb.minprotocol", "label": "Version minimale du protocole", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Aucun(e)", "value": 0}, {"label": "SMBv1", "value": 1}, {"label": "SMBv2", "value": 2}, {"label": "SMBv3", "value": 3}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 3, "enabled": true, "help": "Version maximale du protocole SMB \u00e0 n\u00e9gocier lors des tentatives de connexion. Forcer la compatibilit\u00e9 avec SMBv2 ou SMBv1 peut \u00eatre n\u00e9cessaire avec d'anciens NAS et les partages Windows.", "id": "smb.maxprotocol", "label": "Version maximale de protocole", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Aucun(e)", "value": 0}, {"label": "SMBv1", "value": 1}, {"label": "SMBv2", "value": 2}, {"label": "SMBv3", "value": 3}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 3}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "Force la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 SMBv1 faible pour des raisons de compatibilit\u00e9 avec les fonctionnalit\u00e9s de partage USB sur quelques routeurs Wi-Fi et NAS.", "id": "smb.legacysecurity", "label": "Utiliser la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 traditionnelle", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Activation du service pour rechercher les services SMB en utilisant le protocole WS-Discovery", "id": "services.wsdiscovery", "label": "Activer le service WS-Discovery", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "formatlabel": "{}", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 3, "enabled": true, "help": "Version du protocole NFS \u00e0 utiliser lors de l'\u00e9tablissement de connexions NFS", "id": "nfs.version", "label": "Version du Protocole NFS", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 4, "minimum": 3, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 3}, {"addontype": "xbmc.python.weather", "allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "addon", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Sp\u00e9cifie la source d'informations m\u00e9t\u00e9o pr\u00e9d\u00e9finie. Voir le gestionnaire d'extensions pour les options.", "id": "weather.addon", "label": "Service d'informations m\u00e9t\u00e9o", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": ""}, {"control": {"d