alue": 186}, {"label": "18.7 secondes", "value": 187}, {"label": "18.8 secondes", "value": 188}, {"label": "18.9 secondes", "value": 189}, {"label": "19.0 secondes", "value": 190}, {"label": "19.1 secondes", "value": 191}, {"label": "19.2 secondes", "value": 192}, {"label": "19.3 secondes", "value": 193}, {"label": "19.4 secondes", "value": 194}, {"label": "19.5 secondes", "value": 195}, {"label": "19.6 secondes", "value": 196}, {"label": "19.7 secondes", "value": 197}, {"label": "19.8 secondes", "value": 198}, {"label": "19.9 secondes", "value": 199}, {"label": "20.0 secondes", "value": 200}], "parent": "videoscreen.screen", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "\u00c9limine l'effet de bandes horizontales d\u00fb \u00e0 la conversion des niveaux RVB ou un autre traitement par l'ajout d'un peu de bruit \u00e0 l'image. Cela peut \u00eatre d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9 pour les syst\u00e8mes plus lent, ou si la sortie RVB est en gamme limit\u00e9e et qu'aucun traitement vid\u00e9o n'est n\u00e9cessaire.", "id": "videoscreen.dither", "label": "Tramage", "level": "expert", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Reproduit pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment les couleurs vid\u00e9o en utilisant un profil d'affichage ou une table de concordance 3D.", "id": "videoscreen.cmsenabled", "label": "Gestion des couleurs", "level": "expert", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Utilise l'espace colorim\u00e9trique limit\u00e9 (16-235) au lieu de l'\u00e9tendu (0-255). L'espace limit\u00e9 doit \u00eatre utilis\u00e9 si l'\u00e9cran est une TV HDMI qui ne poss\u00e8de pas un mode PC ou tout autre mode qui permet d'afficher tout l'espace colorim\u00e9trique. Si l'\u00e9cran est un moniteur PC, laisser ce param\u00e8tre d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9 pour avoir des noirs profonds.", "id": "videoscreen.limitedrange", "label": "Utiliser l'espace colorim\u00e9trique restreint (16-235)", "level": "expert", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": [], "definition": {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Les modes en liste blanche permettent \u00e0 l'utilisateur de contr\u00f4ler le choix des modes d'affichage permis ou non \u00e0 utiliser", "id": "videoscreen.whitelist.definition", "label": "Liste blanche", "level": "expert", "options": [{"label": "5120x2160p  50.00Hz", "value": "0512002160050.00000pstd"}, {"label": "4096x2160p  50.00Hz", "value": "0409602160050.00000pstd"}, {"label": "3840x2160p  60.00Hz", "value": "0384002160060.00000pstd"}, {"label": "3840x2160p  59.94Hz", "value": "0384002160059.94010pstd"}, {"label": "3840x2160p  50.00Hz", "value": "0384002160050.00000pstd"}, {"label": "2560x1080p  50.00Hz", "value": "0256001080050.00000pstd"}, {"label": "2048x1152p  60.00Hz", "value": "0204801152060.00000pstd"}, {"label": "1920x1440p  60.00Hz", "value": "0192001440060.00000pstd"}, {"label": "1920x1200p  59.88Hz", "value": "0192001200059.88460pstd"}, {"label": "1920x1080p  60.00Hz", "value": "0192001080060.00000pstd"}, {"label": "1920x1080p  50.00Hz", "value": "0192001080050.00000pstd"}, {"label": "1856x1392p  60.00Hz", "value": "0185601392059.99518pstd"}, {"label": "1792x1344p  60.00Hz", "value": "0179201344059.99979pstd"}, {"label": "1680x1050p  59.95Hz", "value": "0168001050059.95425pstd"}, {"label": "1600x1200p  60.00Hz", "value": "0160001200060.00000pstd"}, {"label": "1440x900p  59.89Hz", "value": "0144000900059.88745pstd"}, {"label": "1400x1050p  59.98Hz", "value": "0140001050059.97844pstd"}, {"label": "1360x768p  60.02Hz", "value": "0136000768060.01516pstd"}, {"label": "1280x1024p  60.02Hz", "value": "0128001024060.01974pstd"}, {"label": "1280x960p  60.00Hz", "value": "0128000960060.00000pstd"}, {"label": "1280x800p  74.99Hz", "value": "0128000800074.99385pstd"}, {"label": "1280x768p  59.87Hz", "value": "0128000768059.87023pstd"}, {"label": "1024x768p  60.00Hz", "value": "0102400768060.00384pstd"}, {"label": "800x600p  60.32Hz", "value": "0080000600060.31654pstd"}, {"label": "640x480p  60.00Hz", "value": "0064000480060.00000pstd"}, {"label": "640x480p  59.94Hz", "value": "0064000480059.94048pstd"}], "parent": "videoscreen.screen", "type": "string", "value": ""}, "delimiter": ",", "elementtype": "string", "enabled": true, "help": "Les modes en liste blanche permettent \u00e0 l'utilisateur de contr\u00f4ler le choix des modes d'affichage permis ou non \u00e0 utiliser", "id": "videoscreen.whitelist", "label": "Liste blanche", "level": "expert", "maximumItems": -1, "minimumItems": 0, "parent": "videoscreen.screen", "type": "list", "value": []}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "S\u00e9lectionner cette option pour autoriser des taux de rafra\u00eechissement 3:2 Pulldown (lecture vid\u00e9o \u00e0 23,976 TPS sur un \u00e9cran \u00e0 59,94 Hz ou \u00e0 24 TPS sur un \u00e9cran \u00e0 60 Hz). \u00c0 utiliser si l'\u00e9cran ne poss\u00e8de pas de modes 23,976 Hz ou 24 Hz.", "id": "videoscreen.whitelistpulldown", "label": "Autoriser des taux de rafra\u00eechissement 3:2 Pulldown", "level": "expert", "parent": "videoscreen.whitelist", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": false, "help": "S\u00e9lectionner cette option pour autoriser des taux de rafra\u00eechissement doubl\u00e9s (lecture vid\u00e9o \u00e0 29,97 TPS sur un \u00e9cran \u00e0 59,94 Hz ou \u00e0 30 TPS sur un \u00e9cran \u00e0 60 Hz). \u00c0 utiliser si l'\u00e9cran ne poss\u00e8de pas de modes 29,97 Hz ou 30 Hz.", "id": "videoscreen.whitelistdoublerefreshrate", "label": "Autoriser des taux de rafra\u00eechissement doubl\u00e9s", "level": "expert", "parent": "videoscreen.whitelist", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Modifie l'affichage 3D st\u00e9r\u00e9oscopique de l'interface utilisateur.", "id": "videoscreen.stereoscopicmode", "label": "Mode 3D st\u00e9r\u00e9oscopique / Actuel", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "D\u00e9sactiv\u00e9", "value": 0}, {"label": "Dessus / Dessous", "value": 1}, {"label": "C\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te", "value": 2}, {"label": "Anaglyphe rouge / cyan", "value": 3}, {"label": "Anaglyphe vert / magenta", "value": 4}, {"label": "Anaglyphe jaune / bleu", "value": 5}, {"label": "Entrelac\u00e9", "value": 6}, {"label": "Bas\u00e9 sur le mat\u00e9riel", "value": 8}, {"label": "Monoscopique / 2D", "value": 9}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 100, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit le mode pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 dans lequel les m\u00e9dias 3D st\u00e9r\u00e9oscopique, tels que les vid\u00e9os, doivent \u00eatre jou\u00e9s.", "id": "videoscreen.preferedstereoscopicmode", "label": "Mode pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Comme le film", "value": 100}, {"label": "Dessus / Dessous", "value": 1}, {"label": "C\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te", "value": 2}, {"label": "Anaglyphe rouge / cyan", "value": 3}, {"label": "Anaglyphe vert / magenta", "value": 4}, {"label": "Anaglyphe jaune / bleu", "value": 5}, {"label": "Entrelac\u00e9", "value": 6}, {"label": "Bas\u00e9 sur le mat\u00e9riel", "value": 8}], "parent": "videoscreen.stereoscopicmode", "type": "integer", "value": 100}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 3, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit le nombre de tampons de pr\u00e9sentation utilis\u00e9s par le pilote graphique. S\u00e9lectionner 2 si le pilote utilise un double tampon ou 3 s'il utilise un triple tampon.", "id": "videoscreen.noofbuffers", "label": "Nombre de tampons utilis\u00e9s par le pilote graphique", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 3, "minimum": 2, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 3}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Calibre l'interface utilisateur en ajustant le suraffichage. Utiliser cet outil si l'image affich\u00e9e est trop grande ou trop petite pour l'\u00e9cran.", "id": "videoscreen.guicalibration", "label": "Calibration vid\u00e9o", "level": "expert", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"allowempty": false, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": "Default", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection du dispositif \u00e0 utiliser pour la lecture des fichiers audio \u00e0 d\u00e9coder tels que MP3.", "id": "audiooutput.audiodevice", "label": "Dispositif de sortie audio", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "Default, Default Output Device (PULSEAUDIO)", "value": "PULSE:Default"}, {"label": "Built-in Audio St\u00e9r\u00e9o analogique, Sortie ligne (PULSEAUDIO)", "value": "PULSE:alsa_output.pci-0000_00_1b.0.analog-stereo"}], "parent": "", "type": "string", "value": "PULSE:Default"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "Choix du nombre de canaux g\u00e9r\u00e9s par la connexion audio, ou le nombre d'enceintes en connexion analogique. Ces param\u00e8tres ne s'appliquent pas au mode laisser-passer (Passthrough).[CR]NB : la sortie S/PDIF g\u00e8re seulement 2.0 canaux mais peut toujours sortir un flux multicanal en utilisant un format g\u00e9r\u00e9 en laisser-passer.", "id": "audiooutput.channels", "label": "Nombre de canaux", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "2.0", "value": 1}, {"label": "2.1", "value": 2}, {"label": "3.0", "value": 3}, {"label": "3.1", "value": 4}, {"label": "4.0", "value": 5}, {"label": "4.1", "value": 6}, {"label": "5.0", "value": 7}, {"label": "5.1", "value": 8}, {"label": "7.0", "value": 9}, {"label": "7.1", "value": 10}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 2, "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lectionne comment d\u00e9finir les propri\u00e9t\u00e9s de la sortie audio :[CR][Fixe] - Les propri\u00e9t\u00e9s de sortie sont d\u00e9finies pour le taux d'\u00e9chantillonnage sp\u00e9cifi\u00e9 et la configuration des enceintes.[CR][Meilleure correspondance] - Les propri\u00e9t\u00e9s de sortie sont d\u00e9finies pour \u00eatre toujours les plus proches possibles de la source.[CR][Optimis\u00e9e] - Les propri\u00e9t\u00e9s de sortie sont d\u00e9finies au d\u00e9but de la lecture et ne changeront pas si les propri\u00e9t\u00e9s de la source sont modifi\u00e9es.", "id": "audiooutput.config", "label": "Configuration de la sortie", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Fixe", "value": 1}, {"label": "Optimis\u00e9e", "value": 2}, {"label": "Meilleure concordance", "value": 3}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 2}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "integer", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 90, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit le nombre de pas pour le contr\u00f4le de volume.", "id": "audiooutput.volumesteps", "label": "Pas du contr\u00f4le de volume", "level": "standard", "maximum": 90, "minimum": 10, "parent": "", "step": 5, "type": "integer", "value": 90}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "\u00c0 s\u00e9lectionner pour par ex. passer de 5.1 \u00e0 2.0.[CR][Activ\u00e9] Maintient le volume sonore de la source audio d'origine mais l'amplitude dynamique sera compress\u00e9e.[CR][D\u00e9sactiv\u00e9] Maintient l'amplitude dynamique de la source audio originale mais avec un volume plus faible.[CR]NB : l'amplitude dynamique est la diff\u00e9rence entre le son le plus faible et le plus fort dans une source audio. Activer ce param\u00e8tre si les dialogues des films sont \u00e0 peine audibles.", "id": "audiooutput.maintainoriginalvolume", "label": "Conserver le volume d'origine en remixage vers st\u00e9r\u00e9o", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 30, "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection de la qualit\u00e9 du r\u00e9\u00e9chantillonnage dans le cas o\u00f9 la sortie audio a besoin d'\u00eatre \u00e0 un taux diff\u00e9rent de celui de la source.[CR][Basse] est rapide et minimisera l'impact sur les ressources du syst\u00e8me, comme le processeur.[CR][Moyenne] et [Haute] utiliseront progressivement plus de ressources du syst\u00e8me.", "id": "audiooutput.processquality", "label": "Qualit\u00e9 du r\u00e9\u00e9chantillonnage", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Basse (rapide)", "value": 20}, {"label": "Moyenne", "value": 30}, {"label": "Haute", "value": 50}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 30}, {"control": {"delayed": true, "format": "integer", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": 2, "enabled": true, "help": "Quand la vitesse est modifi\u00e9e et d\u00e9passe ce seuil, un filtre de correction de hauteur de son (Pitch) sera appliqu\u00e9. Ceci \u00e9vite les d\u00e9formations des voix qui r\u00e9sultent de l'augmentation de la vitesse de lecture vid\u00e9o", "id": "audiooutput.atempothreshold", "label": "Seuil de correction de hauteur de son (Pitch)", "level": "expert", "maximum": 100, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 2}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection du comportement quand aucun son n'est requis ni pour la lecture ni pour les sons de l'interface utilisateur.[CR][Toujours] Un signal inaudible continu est \u00e9mis pour conserver le dispositif audio disponible pour la suite, cependant cela peut bloquer les sons des autres applications.[CR][1-10 minutes] Identique \u00e0 [Toujours], puis l'audio passe en veille apr\u00e8s le d\u00e9lai s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9.[CR][Non] La sortie audio passe en veille.[CR]NB : des sons peuvent \u00eatre manqu\u00e9s si l'audio passe en veille.", "id": "audiooutput.streamsilence", "label": "Garder le dispositif audio actif", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Toujours", "value": 153722867}, {"label": "Non", "value": 0}, {"label": "1 minute", "value": 1}, {"label": "2 minutes", "value": 2}, {"label": "3 minutes", "value": 3}, {"label": "4 minutes", "value": 4}, {"label": "5 minutes", "value": 5}, {"label": "6 minutes", "value": 6}, {"label": "7 minutes", "value": 7}, {"label": "8 minutes", "value": 8}, {"label": "9 minutes", "value": 9}, {"label": "10 minutes", "value": 10}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Pour garder certains amplis allum\u00e9s, un signal al\u00e9atoire \u00e0 tr\u00e8s faible volume leur est envoy\u00e9. Ce param\u00e8tre peut \u00eatre d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9 avec une sortie casque ou audio analogique.", "id": "audiooutput.streamnoise", "label": "Envoyer un bruit inaudible", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "Configure la gestion des sons de l'interface, telle que la navigation dans le menu ou les notifications importantes.", "id": "audiooutput.guisoundmode", "label": "\u00c9mettre les sons de l'interface utilisateur", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "Uniquement hors lecture en cours", "value": 1}, {"label": "Toujours", "value": 2}, {"label": "Jamais", "value": 0}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "percentage", "formatlabel": "{} %", "popup": false, "type": "slider"}, "default": 100, "enabled": true, "help": "Volume relatif pour les sons de l'interface", "id": "audiooutput.guisoundvolume", "label": "Volume", "level": "standard", "maximum": 0, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 100}, {"addontype": "kodi.resource.uisounds", "allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "addon", "type": "button"}, "default": "resource.uisounds.kodi", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lectionne ou d\u00e9sactive les sons utilis\u00e9s par l'interface utilisateur.", "id": "lookandfeel.soundskin", "label": "Sons de l'interface utilisateur", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": "resource.uisounds.kodi"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Configure tous les dispositifs connect\u00e9s.", "id": "input.peripherals", "label": "P\u00e9riph\u00e9riques", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": false, "help": "Affichage et configuration des extensions p\u00e9riph\u00e9riques.", "id": "input.peripherallibraries", "label": "Param\u00e8tres des pilotes", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet d'utiliser une souris ou un \u00e9cran tactile pour contr\u00f4ler l'interface.[CR]NB : le contr\u00f4le de l'application sera perdu en cas de d\u00e9sactivation de ce param\u00e8tre sans la pr\u00e9sence d'un clavier ou d'une t\u00e9l\u00e9commande.", "id": "input.enablemouse", "label": "Activer la gestion de la souris et de l'\u00e9cran tactile", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet d'utiliser une manette de jeu pour contr\u00f4ler l'interface.", "id": "input.enablejoystick", "label": "Activer le support de manettes", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Associe les manettes avec les divers dispositifs d'entr\u00e9e des diff\u00e9rents syst\u00e8mes de jeux.", "id": "input.controllerconfig", "label": "Configurer les manettes connect\u00e9es", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Si la connexion Internet n\u00e9cessite un serveur proxy, le configurer ici.", "id": "network.usehttpproxy", "label": "Utiliser un serveur proxy", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": false, "help": "Configure le type de proxy utilis\u00e9.", "id": "network.httpproxytype", "label": "Type de proxy", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "HTTP", "value": 0}, {"label": "HTTPS", "value": 5}, {"label": "SOCKS4", "value": 1}, {"label": "SOCKS4A", "value": 2}, {"label": "SOCKS5", "value": 3}, {"label": "SOCKS5 avec r\u00e9solution DNS \u00e0 distance", "value": 4}], "parent": "network.usehttpproxy", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": false, "help": "Configure l'adresse du serveur proxy.", "id": "network.httpproxyserver", "label": "Serveur", "level": "standard", "parent": "network.usehttpproxy", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"control": {"delayed": true, "format": "integer", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": 8080, "enabled": false, "help": "Configure le port du serveur proxy.", "id": "network.httpproxyport", "label": "Port", "level": "standard", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1, "parent": "network.usehttpproxy", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 8080}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": false, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": false, "help": "Configure le nom d'utilisateur du serveur proxy.", "id": "network.httpproxyusername", "label": "Nom d'utilisateur", "level": "standard", "parent": "network.usehttpproxy", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": true, "format": "string", "hidden": true, "type": "edit", "verifynewvalue": false}, "default": "", "enabled": false, "help": "Configure le mot de passe du serveur proxy.", "id": "network.httpproxypassword", "label": "Mot de passe", "level": "standard", "parent": "network.usehttpproxy", "type": "string", "value": ""}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Si la connexion Internet a une bande passante limit\u00e9e, utiliser ce param\u00e8tre afin de pr\u00e9server de la bande passante pour cette application dans les limites d\u00e9finies.", "id": "network.bandwidth", "label": "Limiter la bande passante Internet", "level": "standard", "maximum": 102400, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 512, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} min", "minimumlabel": "Non", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Permet d'\u00e9teindre l'affichage au bout d'un certain temps d'inactivit\u00e9. Utile pour les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs qui s'\u00e9teignent lorsqu'il n'y a aucun signal d'affichage d\u00e9tect\u00e9.", "id": "powermanagement.displaysoff", "label": "Mettre l'affichage en veille en cas d'inactivit\u00e9", "level": "basic", "maximum": 120, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 5, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} min", "minimumlabel": "Non", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit le temps d'inactivit\u00e9 avant de d\u00e9clencher l'arr\u00eat de l'application.", "id": "powermanagement.shutdowntime", "label": "D\u00e9finir le d\u00e9lai d'arr\u00eat automatique", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 120, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 5, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit l'action \u00e0 effectuer lorsque le d\u00e9lai d'arr\u00eat expire.", "id": "powermanagement.shutdownstate", "label": "Type d'arr\u00eat", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Arr\u00eater", "value": 1}, {"label": "Mettre en veille", "value": 3}, {"label": "Quitter", "value": 0}, {"label": "Minimiser", "value": 5}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} s", "minimumlabel": "Non", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "D\u00e9finit le temps d'attente \u00e0 ne pas d\u00e9passer pour la connexion r\u00e9seau apr\u00e8s d\u00e9marrage ou r\u00e9veil. Si d\u00e9pass\u00e9, le d\u00e9marrage continue.", "id": "powermanagement.waitfornetwork", "label": "Temps d'attente r\u00e9seau maximal", "level": "advanced", "maximum": 30, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Envoie automatiquement une commande de r\u00e9veil Wake-on-LAN au(x) serveur(s) avant d'acc\u00e9der aux partages de fichiers et services.", "id": "powermanagement.wakeonaccess", "label": "Tenter de r\u00e9veiller les serveurs distants lors de l'acc\u00e8s", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Modifie la mani\u00e8re dont les mises \u00e0 jour des extensions sont g\u00e9r\u00e9es.", "id": "general.addonupdates", "label": "Mises \u00e0 jour", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "Installer les mises \u00e0 jour automatiquement", "value": 0}, {"label": "Notifier mais ne pas installer les mises \u00e0 jour", "value": 1}, {"label": "Ne jamais v\u00e9rifier les mises \u00e0 \u00e0 jour", "value": 2}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Affiche une notification quand une extension a \u00e9t\u00e9 mise \u00e0 jour.", "id": "general.addonnotifications", "label": "Afficher les notifications", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "G\u00e8re les modules et les biblioth\u00e8ques d'appoint install\u00e9s automatiquement en d\u00e9pendance d'autres extensions. Les \u00e9l\u00e9ments marqu\u00e9s comme \u00ab Orphelin \u00bb ne sont plus du tout utilis\u00e9s et peuvent \u00eatre d\u00e9sinstall\u00e9s.", "id": "addons.managedependencies", "label": "G\u00e9rer les d\u00e9pendances", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Supprimer tous les modules et les biblioth\u00e8ques install\u00e9s automatiquement qui sont d\u00e9sormais orphelins.", "id": "addons.removeorphaneddependencies", "label": "Supprimer toutes les extensions orphelines", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Affiche les extensions qui tournent en arri\u00e8re-plan.", "id": "addons.showrunning", "label": "En cours d'\u00e9x\u00e9cution", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Autorise l'installation d'extensions depuis des sources inconnues.", "id": "addons.unknownsources", "label": "Sources inconnues", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "D'origine, les extensions des d\u00e9p\u00f4ts officiels ne sont pas mises \u00e0 jour automatiquement depuis des d\u00e9p\u00f4ts priv\u00e9s. Pour des cas tels que la mise \u00e0 jour en version b\u00eata, cette option peut \u00eatre chang\u00e9e en [N'importe quels d\u00e9p\u00f4ts]. Noter que cette option est moins s\u00e9curis\u00e9e et que son activation pourrait causer des incompatibilit\u00e9s et des plantages.", "id": "addons.updatemode", "label": "Mettre \u00e0 jour les extensions officielles depuis", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "D\u00e9p\u00f4ts officiels seulement (par d\u00e9faut)", "value": 0}, {"label": "N'importe quels d\u00e9p\u00f4ts", "value": 1}], "parent": "addons.unknownsources", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Active la journalisation des informations de d\u00e9bogage. Utile pour identifier les probl\u00e8mes.", "id": "debug.showloginfo", "label": "Activer le mode de d\u00e9bogage", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Active les messages d\u00e9taill\u00e9s des biblioth\u00e8ques additionnelles dans les journaux de d\u00e9bogage.", "id": "debug.extralogging", "label": "Activer la journalisation sp\u00e9cifique de composants", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": [], "definition": {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": false, "help": "Sp\u00e9cifie des biblioth\u00e8ques suppl\u00e9mentaires dont les messages seront inclus dans le journal de d\u00e9bogage.", "id": "debug.setextraloglevel.definition", "label": "Composants sp\u00e9cifiques \u00e0 journaliser...", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour la biblioth\u00e8que [B]SMB[/B]", "value": 32}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour la biblioth\u00e8que [B]libcURL[/B] (HTTP(S), DAV)", "value": 64}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour les biblioth\u00e8ques [B]FFmpeg[/B]", "value": 128}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour les requ\u00eates [B]JSON-RPC[/B]", "value": 1024}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]Audio[/B]", "value": 2048}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]Video[/B]", "value": 32768}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e des [B]infos de timing audio/vid\u00e9o[/B]", "value": 262144}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]Fen\u00eatrage[/B]", "value": 524288}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]enregistreur vid\u00e9o (PVR)[/B]", "value": 1048576}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]guide \u00e9lectronique des programmes (EPG)[/B]", "value": 2097152}, {"label": "Journalisation verbeuse pour le composant [B]Annonceur[/B]", "value": 4194304}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour les appels [B]D-Bus[/B]", "value": 512}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]serveur Web[/B]", "value": 65536}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour la biblioth\u00e8que [B]AirTunes[/B]", "value": 4096}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour les composants [B]UPnP[/B]", "value": 8192}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour la biblioth\u00e8que [B]libCEC[/B]", "value": 16384}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]Base de donn\u00e9es[/B]", "value": 131072}, {"label": "Journalisation d\u00e9taill\u00e9e pour le composant [B]WS-Discovery[/B]", "value": 8388608}], "parent": "debug.extralogging", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, "delimiter": ",", "elementtype": "integer", "enabled": false, "help": "Sp\u00e9cifie des biblioth\u00e8ques suppl\u00e9mentaires dont les messages seront inclus dans le journal de d\u00e9bogage.", "id": "debug.setextraloglevel", "label": "Composants sp\u00e9cifiques \u00e0 journaliser...", "level": "standard", "maximumItems": -1, "minimumItems": 0, "parent": "debug.extralogging", "type": "list", "value": []}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "path", "heading": "Rechercher un dossier", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "S\u00e9lection du dossier o\u00f9 seront enregistr\u00e9es les captures d'\u00e9cran.", "id": "debug.screenshotpath", "label": "Dossier des captures d'\u00e9cran", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "sources": [], "type": "path", "value": "", "writable": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Journalisation des \u00e9v\u00e8nements pour suivre ce qu'il s'est pass\u00e9.", "id": "eventlog.enabled", "label": "Journaliser les \u00e9v\u00e8nements", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "La notification des \u00e9v\u00e8nements permet de d\u00e9crire les op\u00e9rations et actions courantes effectu\u00e9es par le syst\u00e8me ou l'utilisateur.", "id": "eventlog.enablednotifications", "label": "Activer la notification de la journalisation des \u00e9v\u00e8nements", "level": "standard", "parent": "eventlog.enabled", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Affiche tous les \u00e9v\u00e8nements dans le journal des \u00e9v\u00e8nements pour le profil courant qu'\u00e0 partir de certains niveaux.", "id": "eventlog.show", "label": "Afficher le journal des \u00e9v\u00e8nements", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "action"}], "addons": [{"addonid": "audioencoder.kodi.builtin.aac", "author": "spiff", "type": "kodi.audioencoder", "version": "1.0.2"}, {"addonid": "audioencoder.kodi.builtin.wma", "author": "spiff", "type": "kodi.audioencoder", "version": "1.0.2"}, {"addonid": "game.controller.default", "author": "Team Kodi", "type": "kodi.game.controller", "version": "1.0.42"}, {"addonid": "game.controller.keyboard", "author": "Team Kodi", "type": "kodi.game.controller", "version": "1.1.43"}, {"addonid": "game.controller.mouse", "author": "Team Kodi", "type": "kodi.game.controller", "version": "1.0.26"}, {"addonid": "game.controller.snes", "author": "Team Kodi", "type": "kodi.game.controller", "version": "1.0.43"}, {"addonid": "metadata.album.universal", "author": "Olympia, Team Kodi", "type": "xbmc.metadata.scraper.albums", "version": "3.1.20"}, {"addonid": "metadata.artists.universal